WEBVTT

01:31.880 --> 01:32.640
Tomorrow,

01:33.000 --> 01:34.520
we'll head back for New Year.

01:34.720 --> 01:37.200
Mother turns 60 this year,

01:37.800 --> 01:40.680
we'd better bring generous gifts.

01:41.120 --> 01:42.320
And the fifth sister-in-law,

01:42.600 --> 01:45.200
she's the legit daughter
of Lord Changxing.

01:45.520 --> 01:46.840
Now she's expecting,

01:47.000 --> 01:49.360
and my brother's been
sent far off to Hanyang.

01:49.720 --> 01:51.520
Heard Mother's personally

01:52.320 --> 01:54.200
overseeing her every need.

01:54.280 --> 01:56.400
We can't afford to treat her lightly.

01:58.280 --> 01:59.560
I've added 20 percent

01:59.560 --> 02:00.560
on top of the usual gifts.

02:06.960 --> 02:07.680
Mother.

02:09.840 --> 02:11.320
Your cough

02:11.880 --> 02:13.160
sounds worse.

02:14.720 --> 02:15.520
It's nothing,

02:16.200 --> 02:17.000
really.

02:19.840 --> 02:21.280
Madam Ji's not going back?

02:22.120 --> 02:22.840
She didn't fall asleep

02:22.840 --> 02:24.160
till well past midnight.

02:24.440 --> 02:25.960
She woke up feeling off,

02:26.160 --> 02:27.200
so she's not going.

02:27.720 --> 02:28.800
Then I'm not going either.

02:29.720 --> 02:31.480
I'll stay and take care of Madam.

02:31.960 --> 02:33.200
Miss, you're truly devoted.

02:33.640 --> 02:35.040
But this is your first time

02:35.040 --> 02:36.160
paying New Year's respects there.

02:36.720 --> 02:38.360
You should go no matter what.

02:43.200 --> 02:44.280
The main house

02:44.520 --> 02:45.480
has been urging us

02:46.320 --> 02:47.920
to move back for years,

02:48.200 --> 02:50.600
saying family should stay together.

02:54.160 --> 02:55.400
They're merely

02:55.600 --> 02:57.000
after Madam's dowry.

02:57.200 --> 02:57.800
That's why Madam

02:57.800 --> 02:59.079
won't move back.

02:59.840 --> 03:01.440
Master knows it too.

03:02.400 --> 03:04.360
But the main house's been
nobility for generations,

03:04.840 --> 03:06.760
how could they be short on cash?

03:07.720 --> 03:09.240
Big noble families these days

03:09.320 --> 03:10.560
are all show on the outside only.

03:10.800 --> 03:12.680
Nine out of ten are broke.

03:13.360 --> 03:14.920
You'll see when you get there.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.200
Indeed,

03:18.400 --> 03:19.360
we better stay sharp.

03:19.680 --> 03:21.000
No wonder Father

03:21.240 --> 03:22.640
moved out right after the engagement

03:23.000 --> 03:24.880
with the Ji family.

03:25.800 --> 03:27.880
He was already protecting against this.

03:30.600 --> 03:33.040
He really plays it smart.

03:34.480 --> 03:36.480
People in the capital are all schemers.

03:37.079 --> 03:39.000
Madam's too kind,
easy to get taken advantage of.

03:39.760 --> 03:40.920
Good thing you came, Miss.

03:41.040 --> 03:41.920
With you here,

03:42.280 --> 03:44.200
you can help Madam
make the right decisions.

04:27.880 --> 04:28.560
Miss,

04:28.840 --> 04:30.000
what a show!

04:30.880 --> 04:32.000
Of course.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.360
This is the old family estate

04:33.360 --> 04:34.600
from the late master's time.

04:34.680 --> 04:36.120
Way better than our place.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.200
Even Ji Mansion

04:37.200 --> 04:38.680
can't match this.

04:39.159 --> 04:40.480
Right, Jinzhao?

04:41.720 --> 04:42.360
Yeah,

04:42.800 --> 04:43.720
even Ji Mansion

04:43.800 --> 04:45.240
wouldn't spend like this.

04:45.880 --> 04:47.520
Guess the main house's loaded.

04:50.000 --> 04:50.720
Wait,

04:51.200 --> 04:52.000
Uncle Deyuan is just

04:52.000 --> 04:53.920
a Fourth-Rank Investigating Censor,

04:54.720 --> 04:56.440
where'd all this money come from?

04:57.360 --> 04:59.040
From the main house fortune, of course.

05:14.320 --> 05:14.960
Second sister-in-law,

05:15.960 --> 05:17.160
my respects to you.

05:17.520 --> 05:19.000
Happy new year.

05:19.720 --> 05:20.840
Good day to you, Dezhao.

05:21.520 --> 05:24.000
Second Aunt, happy new year.

05:24.280 --> 05:25.640
Happy new year everyone.

05:28.760 --> 05:30.640
This must be Jinzhao.

05:32.680 --> 05:34.480
What a beauty.

05:36.120 --> 05:36.960
It's cold outside,

05:37.040 --> 05:38.120
let's head in.

05:39.200 --> 05:39.840
Come.

05:53.400 --> 05:55.080
Happy new year, Mother.

05:55.080 --> 05:57.120
Happy new year, Grandma.

05:59.240 --> 06:00.280
Alright get up.

06:05.600 --> 06:07.840
Finally everyone's here.

06:14.760 --> 06:15.440
Dezhao.

06:15.840 --> 06:16.600
Jinrong.

06:16.960 --> 06:17.640
Jinxian.

06:18.800 --> 06:20.040
Come to my study,

06:20.240 --> 06:21.120
let's have some tea.

06:36.480 --> 06:37.360
Take a seat.

06:49.840 --> 06:51.280
First time

06:51.280 --> 06:52.720
seeing Jinzhao.

06:53.520 --> 06:54.360
She's turned out

06:54.920 --> 06:56.120
so graceful

06:56.560 --> 06:57.760
and gorgeous,

06:57.960 --> 06:59.560
like a crabapple bloom.

07:01.760 --> 07:02.560
So it seems

07:02.960 --> 07:04.320
all those rumors outside

07:04.560 --> 07:05.560
were just nonsense.

07:08.000 --> 07:09.120
Have you been betrothed?

07:09.680 --> 07:11.160
Not yet, Grandma.

07:12.160 --> 07:13.280
Not yet?

07:13.680 --> 07:14.400
Didn't you already

07:14.400 --> 07:15.440
have a betrothal

07:15.440 --> 07:16.520
with Lord Liu Siyu's family?

07:16.960 --> 07:18.000
Lian,

07:18.360 --> 07:19.800
don't talk like that.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.480
Jinzhao is older than you,

07:22.640 --> 07:23.760
call her sister.

07:25.360 --> 07:26.200
Lian,

07:26.440 --> 07:28.440
you said I was engaged to the Liu family,

07:29.040 --> 07:30.280
how did you know that?

07:31.080 --> 07:32.120
It was Lan,

07:32.120 --> 07:33.360
she wrote it in a letter.

07:36.480 --> 07:37.240
What exactly

07:37.240 --> 07:38.760
did Lan say?

07:40.520 --> 07:41.680
She said

07:41.880 --> 07:43.680
the Liu family came to propose,

07:44.159 --> 07:46.280
but you had your eye on Lord Xian,

07:46.440 --> 07:48.200
so you looked down on Liu Xiancheng.

07:49.080 --> 07:50.280
I didn't say that!

07:51.000 --> 07:52.800
That's exactly what you meant.

07:53.080 --> 07:54.080
I just said

07:54.080 --> 07:55.200
Jinzhao and Lord Xian

07:55.200 --> 07:56.360
are on good terms.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.840
I never said anything else.

07:58.400 --> 07:59.040
But…

07:59.040 --> 08:00.000
Enough.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.400
The Young Lord

08:01.520 --> 08:02.920
is not someone you can gossip about.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.040
Exactly.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.440
The Young Lord is far above us.

08:06.840 --> 08:08.640
Any dealings with our family

08:08.920 --> 08:09.760
are only

08:09.760 --> 08:11.080
out of courtesy

08:11.280 --> 08:12.440
to the Gu Manor's connections.

08:13.120 --> 08:14.240
As for the Liu family.

08:14.840 --> 08:15.560
Lian,

08:15.880 --> 08:18.200
Lan only said they came to propose,

08:18.480 --> 08:20.240
not that the match was set.

08:20.880 --> 08:21.600
Right?

08:22.360 --> 08:23.040
But…

08:29.400 --> 08:30.080
Yes.

08:30.840 --> 08:31.640
That's right.

08:32.200 --> 08:34.240
A proposal isn't a betrothal.

08:34.480 --> 08:35.520
If every proposal

08:35.520 --> 08:36.880
counted as a betrothal,

08:37.039 --> 08:37.919
there'd be no end to it.

08:38.240 --> 08:39.200
If this gets out,

08:39.440 --> 08:40.280
it'll look like our family is eager

08:40.280 --> 08:41.520
to marry off daughters.

08:43.799 --> 08:44.520
Lian,

08:44.720 --> 08:46.440
you're still a Gu girl,

08:46.920 --> 08:48.520
mind what you say.

08:52.520 --> 08:53.360
And Lan,

08:53.560 --> 08:54.640
don't spread things

08:54.640 --> 08:55.440
about me anymore.

08:55.800 --> 08:56.800
We may not

08:56.800 --> 08:58.160
have grown up together,

08:58.560 --> 08:59.880
but I'm still your sister.

09:01.400 --> 09:02.560
We're family.

09:02.920 --> 09:04.440
Even if you don't think for me,

09:04.640 --> 09:05.760
you should think of Father

09:05.960 --> 09:07.280
and the Gu family.

09:07.680 --> 09:08.520
Do you think so?

09:09.120 --> 09:09.680
Yes.

09:10.280 --> 09:11.440
I know I was wrong.

09:12.040 --> 09:12.920
Alright.

09:14.080 --> 09:15.240
We're all family.

09:15.560 --> 09:16.320
Talk it out

09:16.320 --> 09:17.560
and it's fine,

09:18.000 --> 09:19.240
nothing serious.

09:20.360 --> 09:21.240
Both Lan

09:21.520 --> 09:23.120
and Jinzhao

09:23.320 --> 09:24.400
are good girls.

09:24.920 --> 09:25.600
They'll both

09:25.880 --> 09:27.640
find good matches.

09:29.160 --> 09:30.440
Especially Jinzhao.

09:33.920 --> 09:35.160
I heard

09:35.880 --> 09:36.880
your maternal grandmother

09:37.080 --> 09:38.360
left you all her properties

09:38.520 --> 09:39.800
in the capital

09:40.080 --> 09:41.200
as your dowry.

09:42.440 --> 09:43.600
You'll need

09:43.960 --> 09:45.920
a fine husband indeed.

09:46.320 --> 09:47.880
I'll keep an eye out for you as well.

09:49.720 --> 09:51.680
Lian did have a match

09:52.440 --> 09:53.520
with the legit son

09:53.520 --> 09:55.720
of Lord Yao Ping,
Vice Minister of Justice.

09:57.120 --> 09:58.080
Everyone praised it,

09:58.400 --> 09:59.560
said it's a good match.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.240
How did I become the topic?

10:04.760 --> 10:06.120
I don't care for this talk.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.360
You all carry on.

10:08.080 --> 10:08.760
Lan,

10:08.960 --> 10:09.760
let's go watch the opera.

10:09.960 --> 10:10.560
Alright,

10:10.680 --> 10:12.160
all of you, go enjoy the opera.

10:12.960 --> 10:13.720
Mother,

10:14.160 --> 10:15.920
hasn't arrived yet.

10:17.040 --> 10:17.880
Her again.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.520
She's late every time.

10:20.880 --> 10:21.600
It's all your fault.

10:21.840 --> 10:22.960
If I hadn't gone to pick you up,

10:23.120 --> 10:24.120
I wouldn't be late.

10:24.640 --> 10:25.640
I only said I was coming,

10:25.800 --> 10:27.080
never asked you to pick me up.

10:27.240 --> 10:28.360
You said you were coming,

10:28.480 --> 10:29.600
how could I not go pick you up?

10:37.240 --> 10:38.680
Young Lord, you're here.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.720
Greetings, Young Lord,

10:41.080 --> 10:41.840
Aunt.

10:43.920 --> 10:44.720
Greetings, Ma'am.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.160
Happy New Year.

10:46.760 --> 10:47.960
Happy New Year, Young Lord.

10:48.320 --> 10:49.080
Please sit.

10:55.840 --> 10:57.520
Mother, listen.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.000
We sent someone
to ask before the New Year,

10:59.240 --> 11:00.240
he said he wouldn't come this year.

11:00.640 --> 11:01.280
This morning,

11:01.280 --> 11:02.640
he suddenly sent word
saying he was coming,

11:02.720 --> 11:04.320
so I had to rush out to pick him up.

11:04.600 --> 11:06.160
He really does change his mind on a whim,

11:06.520 --> 11:07.720
making me late.

11:08.600 --> 11:10.160
Your pregnancy is progressing,

11:10.800 --> 11:12.400
need to be extra careful.

11:13.080 --> 11:15.280
It doesn't matter being late or not.

11:15.720 --> 11:16.800
Just take it easy.

11:18.560 --> 11:20.000
Since everyone's here,

11:20.520 --> 11:21.640
let's go watch the opera.

11:22.160 --> 11:22.880
Lian,

11:23.360 --> 11:24.920
look after your sisters.

11:25.120 --> 11:26.360
Especially Jinzhao,

11:26.760 --> 11:28.160
it's her first time here.

11:29.280 --> 11:30.640
Me looking after her?

11:32.040 --> 11:33.280
She's older than me,

11:33.360 --> 11:34.520
she doesn't need my care.

11:36.720 --> 11:37.640
Lord Xian,

11:37.840 --> 11:38.760
let's go.

11:39.600 --> 11:40.360
What's the rush?

11:40.800 --> 11:42.080
I'm older than you too,

11:42.560 --> 11:43.880
so I don't need your care either.

11:47.120 --> 11:48.200
What's taking so long?

11:48.400 --> 11:49.120
Hurry up!

11:51.880 --> 11:52.640
Let's go!

11:58.920 --> 12:00.400
Grandma, I'll stay with you.

12:04.120 --> 12:05.440
I'm going with you.

12:07.200 --> 12:08.280
She's the obedient one.

12:08.800 --> 12:09.440
Let's go.

12:21.440 --> 12:23.560
You sisters sit here,

12:23.680 --> 12:24.960
chat and laugh a bit,

12:25.080 --> 12:26.240
that's how it should be.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.280
All the operas chosen today

13:13.280 --> 13:14.000
- are good.
- Glad you like them.

13:14.120 --> 13:14.960
I like them all.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.080
Good.

13:52.280 --> 13:53.000
What are you doing?

13:53.480 --> 13:54.160
Still looking?

13:54.600 --> 13:55.840
Go take a closer look then.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.600
Stop talking nonsense!

13:59.520 --> 14:00.400
Don't think

14:00.400 --> 14:01.480
I don't know what you're thinking.

14:02.160 --> 14:03.760
Jinzhao has a thing for him?

14:04.240 --> 14:06.840
I think you're the one who's interested.

14:08.040 --> 14:09.200
Think about

14:09.480 --> 14:11.080
his status.

14:11.480 --> 14:12.920
Even I don't dare think too much.

14:13.120 --> 14:14.800
You really are bold.

14:16.520 --> 14:18.000
I'm not thinking anything.

14:18.600 --> 14:19.440
I just

14:19.440 --> 14:20.720
think he looks good

14:21.040 --> 14:22.120
and took a few extra glances.

14:27.960 --> 14:29.760
He really does look good.

14:30.200 --> 14:32.520
But that temper of his,

14:32.720 --> 14:33.560
better not test it.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.240
Don't know

14:36.400 --> 14:38.120
what he sees in Jinzhao,

14:38.120 --> 14:39.600
he actually pays more attention to her.

14:42.160 --> 14:42.960
My Father said

14:43.160 --> 14:44.720
Jinzhao even dares to talk back

14:44.880 --> 14:46.160
to Uncle Dezhao
in front of outsiders.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.080
Is that true?

14:47.520 --> 14:48.520
Don't even bring it up!

14:48.800 --> 14:49.960
Ever since she came back,

14:49.960 --> 14:51.440
my life's been hard!

14:51.720 --> 14:52.920
Even wanting an extra dish,

14:53.120 --> 14:53.960
I have to go to the kitchen

14:53.960 --> 14:55.680
and pay extra to get it.

14:57.400 --> 14:58.800
And you just put up with it?

14:59.200 --> 15:00.400
What else can I do?

15:00.560 --> 15:01.560
She's the legit daughter,

15:01.800 --> 15:02.640
what am I?

15:03.760 --> 15:05.000
So what if she's the legit daughter?

15:05.520 --> 15:06.760
I'm a legit daughter too!

15:07.360 --> 15:08.920
I've never bullied anyone.

15:21.400 --> 15:22.840
Do you know what Cao Cao's

15:22.840 --> 15:24.520
two biggest mistakes in his life were?

15:29.520 --> 15:31.360
One was mistakenly executing Cai Mao,

15:31.520 --> 15:32.880
the other was letting Guan Yu go.

15:34.160 --> 15:35.600
Cai Mao should've been put to good use.

15:36.240 --> 15:36.960
But Guan Yu

15:38.000 --> 15:38.960
should've been killed.

15:41.400 --> 15:42.440
Don't you agree?

15:45.520 --> 15:46.200
Second Aunt,

15:46.720 --> 15:47.920
this opera is really good.

15:48.000 --> 15:49.240
Which troupe is it from?

15:49.360 --> 15:51.320
It's the Spring Grass Troupe
from south of the city.

16:11.400 --> 16:13.280
This is truly outrageous!

16:20.720 --> 16:21.760
I need to change clothes.

16:22.040 --> 16:23.240
Miss, this way please.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.760
I need to change too.

16:43.000 --> 16:43.720
Wait a moment!

16:44.120 --> 16:44.960
Let's go together

16:45.200 --> 16:46.320
after this act.

17:02.520 --> 17:03.400
Running away without a fight,

17:03.680 --> 17:04.440
doesn't suit you.

17:06.720 --> 17:08.359
Can you stop following me?

17:10.040 --> 17:11.079
Your handkerchief…

17:11.200 --> 17:11.839
Young Lord,

17:11.960 --> 17:12.960
I can't afford to offend you!

17:13.079 --> 17:14.359
And I don't want another whipping!

17:14.720 --> 17:15.599
Please just let me go,

17:15.599 --> 17:16.359
can you?

17:17.680 --> 17:18.680
You can't afford to offend me,

17:19.000 --> 17:20.359
so you can afford Chen Yanyun?

17:22.760 --> 17:23.680
What did you say?

17:24.800 --> 17:25.720
Don't talk nonsense!

17:26.319 --> 17:27.200
Nonsense?

17:27.680 --> 17:29.680
New Year's Eve, City God Temple festival,

17:30.360 --> 17:31.680
I saw it myself

17:31.680 --> 17:32.560
that Chen guy

17:33.000 --> 17:34.320
jumped into the river to save you.

17:35.840 --> 17:36.760
That never happened!

17:37.520 --> 17:38.720
You're spreading rumors!

17:39.520 --> 17:40.360
If I'm spreading rumors,

17:40.680 --> 17:41.560
may I be struck by lightning.

17:42.240 --> 17:43.160
And if you're lying,

17:43.400 --> 17:44.440
you too.

17:45.240 --> 17:46.200
Meeting you already

17:46.600 --> 17:48.120
feels like I've been struck by lightning!

17:49.840 --> 17:50.600
There's a higher spot,

17:50.880 --> 17:52.240
go stand there and say it if you dare!

17:53.480 --> 17:54.440
You think I won't?

17:54.840 --> 17:55.960
Of course you dare!

17:56.600 --> 17:57.640
You'd dare anything!

17:57.800 --> 17:58.480
You are

17:58.480 --> 17:59.880
the noble Young Lord!

18:00.040 --> 18:01.400
What wouldn't you dare?

18:02.200 --> 18:03.000
What are people like us

18:03.000 --> 18:04.440
worth in your eyes?

18:04.680 --> 18:05.680
You just say

18:05.720 --> 18:06.400
and do whatever you want!

18:06.680 --> 18:07.560
Gu Jinzhao,

18:07.880 --> 18:08.640
you've gone too far!

18:08.720 --> 18:09.840
So what if I have?

18:10.160 --> 18:11.240
Kill me if you can!

18:11.240 --> 18:11.800
You…

18:24.120 --> 18:25.720
You ungrateful thing!

18:27.360 --> 18:28.640
If I weren't considering

18:29.040 --> 18:30.360
you once saved my life…

18:35.120 --> 18:36.560
Xian, Jinzhao.

18:36.800 --> 18:37.720
Aunt.

18:40.120 --> 18:41.320
What are you two doing here?

18:44.280 --> 18:45.080
Her handkerchief fell,

18:45.520 --> 18:46.440
I picked it up for her.

18:47.280 --> 18:48.120
I'm returning it now.

18:50.320 --> 18:51.400
Young Lord is mistaken,

18:51.680 --> 18:52.800
this isn't mine.

18:54.080 --> 18:55.400
I clearly saw it was yours!

18:55.520 --> 18:56.760
How can you lie like that?

18:57.160 --> 18:58.080
How is it not yours?

18:58.280 --> 18:59.440
How could I not

18:59.680 --> 19:00.720
recognize my own thing?

19:03.360 --> 19:04.360
It's cold in the courtyard,

19:05.080 --> 19:06.520
I'll take my leave, Aunt,

19:06.520 --> 19:07.400
Young Lord.

19:07.560 --> 19:08.360
I was going to go

19:08.360 --> 19:09.640
get my hand warmer anyway.

19:12.920 --> 19:13.600
Gu Jinzhao!

19:14.000 --> 19:14.640
Enough.

19:15.160 --> 19:16.720
She said it's not hers.

19:16.840 --> 19:17.480
Are you going

19:17.480 --> 19:18.560
to force her to take it?

19:19.280 --> 19:20.200
What handkerchief?

19:20.520 --> 19:21.120
Give it to me.

19:22.960 --> 19:23.680
Why would I give it to you?

19:24.640 --> 19:25.320
I picked it up.

19:26.960 --> 19:28.520
Where are you going?
The feast is about to start!

19:30.000 --> 19:31.000
All grown up now,

19:31.000 --> 19:32.360
still no sense of propriety.

19:33.160 --> 19:33.720
Miss,

19:33.880 --> 19:35.720
but Young Lord's already of age.

19:36.240 --> 19:37.000
Yes,

19:37.440 --> 19:38.200
he's of age.

19:46.240 --> 19:47.080
That's not fair!

19:47.080 --> 19:48.040
You are two people!

19:56.440 --> 19:57.600
Ma'am,

19:57.640 --> 19:58.680
ladies,

19:58.720 --> 19:59.520
young masters!

19:59.520 --> 20:00.760
The snacks are here!

20:02.560 --> 20:03.720
- 30,000 coins.
- Snacks are here!

20:23.640 --> 20:25.040
The handkerchief's still with Xian.

20:25.480 --> 20:26.640
If he goes crazy

20:26.640 --> 20:27.680
and takes it out,

20:27.840 --> 20:29.240
and someone notices

20:29.240 --> 20:30.600
my stitching matches it,

20:30.920 --> 20:31.640
I'm in trouble.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.240
You're all set, right?

20:35.880 --> 20:36.920
Nicely done!

20:39.160 --> 20:40.280
Lan's lotus

20:40.280 --> 20:41.320
is well done too.

20:42.960 --> 20:43.760
Jinzhao.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.360
What's wrong?

20:47.080 --> 20:47.880
Second Aunt,

20:48.080 --> 20:49.240
my embroidery isn't good,

20:49.480 --> 20:50.440
not worth showing.

20:51.720 --> 20:53.040
It's fine.

20:53.400 --> 20:54.560
Ma'am just likes

20:54.840 --> 20:56.760
girls doing needlework.

20:57.080 --> 20:58.480
So we're all just

20:58.760 --> 21:00.120
keeping her entertained.

21:00.520 --> 21:01.520
Don't take it seriously.

21:01.800 --> 21:03.000
Thank you for the advice, Second Aunt.

21:03.760 --> 21:04.800
Second Madam, please come quick!

21:05.920 --> 21:06.840
Coming!

21:07.600 --> 21:08.600
Keep stitching.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.440
Lan,

21:16.000 --> 21:17.080
how is

21:17.240 --> 21:18.920
your lotus so good?

21:19.400 --> 21:21.280
I just learned a bit from my mother.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.960
Your mother's that good too?

21:23.200 --> 21:24.640
Isn't she from a merchant family?

21:26.840 --> 21:27.520
Oh right,

21:27.760 --> 21:29.400
you mean "mother".

21:33.680 --> 21:34.360
- Uncle.
- What are you looking at?

21:34.360 --> 21:35.080
Try this pastry.

21:35.800 --> 21:36.800
Just because of my

21:36.800 --> 21:37.960
"merchant's daughter" comment?

21:37.960 --> 21:38.520
[Jinxian,]

21:38.760 --> 21:39.200
[your turn!]

21:39.200 --> 21:40.800
Did it hit your nerve too?

21:46.960 --> 21:48.480
Why are you shaking your head?

21:49.200 --> 21:49.840
You people

21:49.840 --> 21:50.920
from merchant families

21:51.160 --> 21:52.640
are always so petty!

21:52.840 --> 21:53.480
Say it

21:53.720 --> 21:55.040
if you've got the guts.

21:56.080 --> 21:57.840
Since you act so high and mighty,

21:58.240 --> 21:59.240
why are you wearing

21:59.240 --> 22:01.000
a fake gold cicada hairpin?

22:03.920 --> 22:04.760
What did you say?

22:05.080 --> 22:06.360
Fake?

22:06.960 --> 22:08.120
Then I'll say it straight.

22:08.960 --> 22:10.240
This gold cicada hairpin

22:10.240 --> 22:11.680
is this autumn's design

22:11.800 --> 22:13.080
from my maternal family's jewelry shop.

22:13.640 --> 22:14.560
Just that cicada alone

22:14.720 --> 22:16.200
used three taels of gold.

22:16.840 --> 22:18.000
If I'm not mistaken,

22:18.320 --> 22:19.600
the one you're wearing

22:19.720 --> 22:21.360
is hollow, gold-plated.

22:22.000 --> 22:22.760
Don't believe me? Look,

22:23.680 --> 22:24.880
the gold on the sides

22:25.240 --> 22:25.840
is already worn off.

22:28.720 --> 22:29.840
Nonsense!

22:30.680 --> 22:31.600
Nonsense or not,

22:31.600 --> 22:33.040
you know in your heart.

22:33.120 --> 22:34.760
If you want proof,

22:35.200 --> 22:36.640
take it off

22:37.040 --> 22:37.840
and drop it in water.

22:38.560 --> 22:40.480
If it floats,

22:41.000 --> 22:42.040
that'd be something.

22:46.760 --> 22:47.560
Girls,

22:49.760 --> 22:50.800
how's the embroidery?

22:52.080 --> 22:52.960
Grandma.

22:55.800 --> 22:56.760
This lotus

22:57.080 --> 22:58.600
looks almost alive.

22:59.400 --> 23:00.320
You must

23:00.520 --> 23:01.640
have practiced a lot.

23:02.360 --> 23:03.360
Thank you, Grandma.

23:03.840 --> 23:04.680
A koi?

23:06.880 --> 23:08.440
A bit weaker than the lotus.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.280
Grandma!

23:11.520 --> 23:12.400
Still not bad.

23:13.920 --> 23:15.160
How's Jinzhao's work?

23:15.480 --> 23:16.520
Let me have a look.

23:16.680 --> 23:17.320
Grandma,

23:17.560 --> 23:18.960
my skills are poor,

23:19.360 --> 23:20.360
it's not well done.

23:22.040 --> 23:23.040
Even if it's not good,

23:23.240 --> 23:24.720
you can still show it!

23:26.520 --> 23:27.600
No way, Jinzhao,

23:28.280 --> 23:28.600
this…

23:28.840 --> 23:30.120
did you really make it?

23:33.040 --> 23:34.640
What's this supposed to be?

23:35.000 --> 23:35.560
Look at this!

23:37.680 --> 23:38.120
This…

23:39.680 --> 23:40.320
This is…

23:41.080 --> 23:42.240
It's a butterfly.

23:42.880 --> 23:43.960
A butterfly?

23:44.200 --> 23:44.840
I thought

23:44.840 --> 23:46.320
it was a moth!

23:47.640 --> 23:48.160
What,

23:48.480 --> 23:48.880
your mother

23:48.880 --> 23:50.120
never taught you needlework?

23:52.280 --> 23:53.000
Oh right,

23:53.240 --> 23:54.920
you were kicked out as a child

23:54.960 --> 23:56.680
and raised by your grandmother.

23:59.640 --> 24:01.600
I heard the Ji family
is the richest in Tongzhou.

24:01.800 --> 24:02.640
Well,

24:03.040 --> 24:03.760
what's the point

24:03.760 --> 24:04.680
of a big dowry?

24:05.000 --> 24:06.040
Proper upbringing still matters.

24:06.040 --> 24:06.560
It's Jinzhao's.

24:07.000 --> 24:07.960
With skills like that,

24:08.120 --> 24:09.160
how will you face

24:09.280 --> 24:10.200
your in-laws later?

24:10.880 --> 24:11.680
Lian,

24:12.240 --> 24:14.320
the Ji family in Tongzhou are your elders,

24:14.760 --> 24:16.240
how can you talk like that?

24:16.840 --> 24:17.440
Exactly.

24:17.880 --> 24:19.040
My poor skills are on me,

24:19.160 --> 24:20.400
what does it have
to do with my grandparents?

24:21.280 --> 24:21.880
Right.

24:22.400 --> 24:23.960
That wasn't fair, Lian.

24:24.520 --> 24:25.680
I heard

24:25.720 --> 24:26.560
Mrs. Ji

24:26.560 --> 24:28.160
hired Ms. Xue

24:28.480 --> 24:29.800
from Silken Pavilion

24:29.800 --> 24:30.640
just to teach

24:30.640 --> 24:32.080
her needlework.

24:33.160 --> 24:33.760
Then why

24:33.760 --> 24:35.200
is it so crude?

24:35.560 --> 24:37.280
Is that all Silken Pavilion can teach?

24:38.560 --> 24:40.600
Maybe you're new here,

24:40.680 --> 24:41.640
just playing it down, right?

24:42.160 --> 24:43.360
We're all family,

24:43.440 --> 24:44.720
no need to be so modest.

24:45.560 --> 24:46.440
I happen to have

24:46.440 --> 24:48.200
a handkerchief she embroidered herself.

24:48.640 --> 24:49.720
You'll see once you look.

24:52.960 --> 24:53.480
Mother,

24:53.960 --> 24:54.600
look!

24:54.800 --> 24:56.160
This orchid,

24:56.680 --> 24:58.120
both form and spirit are perfect!

24:59.120 --> 25:00.680
So lifelike.

25:01.480 --> 25:02.360
What's that she stitched?

25:02.600 --> 25:03.320
Let me see.

25:06.840 --> 25:07.880
Jinzhao stitched it.

25:15.760 --> 25:16.880
It's really well done.

25:17.800 --> 25:18.480
Jinzhao,

25:19.040 --> 25:21.080
did you really embroider this?

25:23.520 --> 25:24.280
Yes.

25:32.680 --> 25:33.560
My luck's

25:33.640 --> 25:34.440
great today!

25:37.600 --> 25:38.360
Jinzhao.

25:40.760 --> 25:41.400
Jinxian,

25:42.000 --> 25:42.480
I need to speak

25:42.480 --> 25:43.840
to the Young Lord alone.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.320
Okay, I'll leave you to chat.

25:49.720 --> 25:50.440
Mad?

25:51.640 --> 25:53.080
Mad I made you admit

25:53.640 --> 25:54.640
the handkerchief was yours?

25:56.720 --> 25:57.600
Get this straight,

25:57.960 --> 25:59.440
I was helping you.

26:00.640 --> 26:01.960
Thanks for the help, Young Lord.

26:02.400 --> 26:04.400
Next time, please don't.

26:06.000 --> 26:07.080
So I was wrong?

26:07.680 --> 26:08.360
You gave my handkerchief

26:08.360 --> 26:09.320
to Lan,

26:09.600 --> 26:10.480
what do you think she'll think?

26:10.840 --> 26:11.840
So that's what you're worried about?

26:13.040 --> 26:14.160
She won't say anything.

26:15.720 --> 26:16.880
How do you know she won't?

26:18.120 --> 26:18.920
When I speak,

26:19.280 --> 26:19.840
who dares not listen,

26:20.200 --> 26:21.240
besides you?

26:22.360 --> 26:23.360
What about Aunt?

26:24.480 --> 26:25.240
She was there.

26:25.800 --> 26:26.720
She saw

26:26.720 --> 26:27.520
what happened.

26:28.160 --> 26:28.760
Jinzhao,

26:28.760 --> 26:29.920
why are you so fussy?

26:30.080 --> 26:31.040
What are you afraid of?

26:31.280 --> 26:32.240
She's my sister!

26:34.120 --> 26:35.480
You wouldn't understand.

26:50.200 --> 26:51.640
Jinzhao, where are you going?

26:55.680 --> 26:56.480
Slow down.

27:23.360 --> 27:24.440
Everything has its fate.

27:25.080 --> 27:25.720
This cat

27:26.120 --> 27:27.040
was probably bitten

27:27.040 --> 27:27.720
in a fight.

27:28.360 --> 27:29.080
It won't live long.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.440
Saving it now

27:31.840 --> 27:32.520
will only make it

27:32.520 --> 27:33.480
suffer more.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.200
So by your logic,

27:35.200 --> 27:36.320
I shouldn't have saved you

27:36.440 --> 27:37.280
at Blessed Fane either.

27:38.280 --> 27:39.880
You've got your own fate anyway.

27:54.120 --> 27:55.280
Do you want to save it

27:55.440 --> 27:57.000
or put it out of its misery?

28:30.440 --> 28:30.920
My lord.

28:51.280 --> 28:52.160
What are you staring at?

28:52.840 --> 28:54.000
Always causing me trouble.

28:54.720 --> 28:55.480
Didn't expect you

28:55.480 --> 28:57.120
to be so patient with a cat,

28:57.520 --> 28:58.920
yet so cruel to people.

29:00.520 --> 29:01.440
You've got a death wish?

29:02.080 --> 29:03.640
Want another whipping?

29:05.880 --> 29:07.440
Looks like you really resent me.

29:07.960 --> 29:09.160
Wouldn't you?

29:09.480 --> 29:10.680
I didn't provoke you at all

29:10.680 --> 29:11.760
and still got whipped.

29:12.400 --> 29:13.480
And that Mr. Zhang.

29:14.160 --> 29:15.480
He fell seriously ill

29:15.680 --> 29:16.920
just because of your prank.

29:17.280 --> 29:18.280
He's totally innocent!

29:19.520 --> 29:20.360
He's innocent?

29:20.560 --> 29:21.400
I'm the innocent one!

29:21.800 --> 29:22.560
If you hadn't

29:22.560 --> 29:23.600
stood me up for no reason,

29:24.360 --> 29:25.680
why would I lose my temper?

29:26.200 --> 29:27.080
Stood you up?

29:27.560 --> 29:28.800
When did I ever do that?

29:29.840 --> 29:30.840
Playing dumb?

29:31.560 --> 29:32.720
I sent you an invitation

29:33.800 --> 29:35.040
and you snubbed me.

29:35.840 --> 29:36.520
What,

29:37.480 --> 29:38.640
was I supposed to tolerate that?

29:38.880 --> 29:39.920
Invitation?

29:40.560 --> 29:42.200
I never got anything.

29:46.880 --> 29:47.680
Xianhuai.

29:56.880 --> 29:57.600
So,

29:57.880 --> 29:58.440
the handkerchief

29:58.440 --> 29:59.880
was given to the Young Lord
by Ms. Jinzhao?

30:00.280 --> 30:00.600
Then…

30:02.240 --> 30:04.160
Wouldn't that be a private exchange?

30:04.400 --> 30:05.600
It's not her first time

30:05.600 --> 30:06.640
doing that.

30:21.280 --> 30:22.240
Jinzhao, you're here.

30:22.480 --> 30:23.480
Still up so late?

30:23.680 --> 30:24.240
Come in.

30:25.240 --> 30:26.360
I came to thank you

30:26.920 --> 30:28.320
for speaking up for me.

30:29.560 --> 30:30.480
You mean

30:30.480 --> 30:31.320
the embroidery thing?

30:31.520 --> 30:32.840
We're sisters.

30:33.040 --> 30:34.600
They were mocking your grandmother,

30:34.720 --> 30:35.960
of course I'd defend you.

30:37.160 --> 30:38.080
So I won't pursue

30:38.080 --> 30:39.680
you hiding Ye Xian's invitation

30:40.000 --> 30:41.160
from me.

30:46.000 --> 30:47.160
What invitation?

30:48.160 --> 30:48.720
Well,

30:49.040 --> 30:50.280
whether Ye Xian pursues it,

30:50.440 --> 30:51.360
that's another matter.

30:52.200 --> 30:53.440
What are you talking about?

30:55.720 --> 30:58.320
When I first returned,

30:58.520 --> 31:00.160
you had no issue with me.

31:00.880 --> 31:01.280
I…

31:01.640 --> 31:03.320
I suppose lately

31:03.320 --> 31:04.480
things have changed in the house.

31:04.960 --> 31:05.800
Because of me,

31:06.080 --> 31:08.000
Concubine Song took some losses.

31:09.160 --> 31:10.720
So you resent me.

31:10.840 --> 31:12.040
You think my return

31:12.200 --> 31:13.040
got in your way.

31:14.200 --> 31:16.160
I've never thought that.

31:17.480 --> 31:19.120
I'm a straightforward person.

31:20.280 --> 31:21.240
Yes, I'm the legit daughter

31:21.360 --> 31:22.080
and you're not.

31:22.680 --> 31:24.040
But since I was a baby,

31:24.200 --> 31:25.640
I grew up at my grandmother's.

31:26.440 --> 31:27.240
I never lived a day

31:27.240 --> 31:28.040
as a true legit daughter.

31:28.520 --> 31:29.040
And you,

31:29.480 --> 31:30.480
since birth,

31:30.800 --> 31:32.320
you were the only miss in the house.

31:33.000 --> 31:33.920
Not legit,

31:34.320 --> 31:35.560
yet treated like one.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.400
What I'm saying

31:37.760 --> 31:38.680
is just to tell you

31:39.760 --> 31:41.640
that in my eyes there's no such divide.

31:42.360 --> 31:44.040
You don't need to see me as a rival.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.080
Jinzhao, that's really unfair

31:47.080 --> 31:48.400
of you to say.

31:49.360 --> 31:50.680
How am I supposed to take that?

31:53.160 --> 31:54.200
I've said my piece.

31:54.720 --> 31:56.000
If you take it in, good.

31:56.320 --> 31:57.360
If not,

31:57.600 --> 31:58.520
and you keep stirring trouble,

31:59.160 --> 31:59.920
I'm not the type

31:59.920 --> 32:01.080
to repay evil with kindness.

32:01.920 --> 32:03.240
Qingpu, let's go.

32:08.720 --> 32:10.040
So fake and pretentious!

32:10.760 --> 32:12.120
I don't believe
that if roles were reversed,

32:12.280 --> 32:13.600
she could still be so detached!

32:14.080 --> 32:14.960
Just talking big

32:14.960 --> 32:15.760
without feeling it herself.

32:17.560 --> 32:18.000
Let's go!

32:25.280 --> 32:26.160
[Didn't expect you]

32:26.160 --> 32:27.840
[to be so patient with a cat,]

32:28.160 --> 32:29.600
[yet so cruel to people.]

32:35.400 --> 32:36.120
Miss.

32:37.800 --> 32:38.440
Sis.

32:39.560 --> 32:40.640
What are you doing outside?

32:40.960 --> 32:42.040
Aren't you cold?

32:43.200 --> 32:43.840
Cold is good,

32:44.120 --> 32:44.800
keeps the mind clear.

32:45.960 --> 32:47.080
Always full of strange ideas.

32:48.480 --> 32:49.240
You're afraid of the cold,

32:49.640 --> 32:50.720
I'll help you inside.

32:55.560 --> 32:56.120
Sis,

32:56.320 --> 32:56.880
please sit.

33:04.160 --> 33:05.960
Before the New Year,
I attended a banquet

33:05.960 --> 33:06.960
for Lord Wuning's birthday banquet,

33:07.200 --> 33:08.680
and ran into Viscount Weiyuan's wife.

33:09.200 --> 33:09.800
Only then did I know

33:09.800 --> 33:11.240
their second son is already engaged

33:11.440 --> 33:12.120
to the youngest daughter

33:12.120 --> 33:13.240
of Lord Wuning,

33:13.400 --> 33:14.400
Qiu Fang.

33:14.680 --> 33:16.880
I remember he's about your age,

33:17.280 --> 33:18.800
maybe even a few months younger.

33:19.760 --> 33:20.680
To be honest,

33:21.400 --> 33:23.280
mother also mentioned your marriage.

33:23.960 --> 33:24.920
I said,

33:25.480 --> 33:27.120
Xian's always had
his own ideas since childhood,

33:27.440 --> 33:28.120
so this

33:28.400 --> 33:29.880
should be his decision.

33:30.280 --> 33:31.160
Do you think so?

33:33.080 --> 33:33.920
Why are you laughing?

33:36.480 --> 33:37.400
I'm just laughing

33:37.600 --> 33:39.000
that you always like

33:39.000 --> 33:40.320
to beat around the bush.

33:41.280 --> 33:42.320
Doesn't it get tiring?

33:42.920 --> 33:43.560
Fine,

33:44.040 --> 33:45.160
I'll be direct then.

33:46.800 --> 33:47.920
You're of age now,

33:48.240 --> 33:49.360
and you're the only heir of the family.

33:50.040 --> 33:51.760
Mother and father plan

33:51.920 --> 33:53.160
to start looking for a match this spring.

33:53.520 --> 33:54.760
Get married early,

33:55.000 --> 33:56.120
so you can carry on

33:56.120 --> 33:57.040
the family line.

33:59.640 --> 34:00.280
Yeah.

34:00.840 --> 34:02.040
Even if I die early,

34:02.720 --> 34:03.760
you'll all feel more at ease, right?

34:04.080 --> 34:05.240
What are you saying?

34:06.920 --> 34:08.480
Since you care so much
about continuing the family line,

34:08.880 --> 34:10.120
go have your own children.

34:10.880 --> 34:11.679
Even letting your husband

34:11.679 --> 34:12.840
take concubines is fine.

34:13.320 --> 34:14.520
Why drag me into it?

34:15.040 --> 34:16.120
I can't handle you anymore?

34:23.560 --> 34:24.560
You wouldn't happen

34:25.040 --> 34:26.760
to like a Gu girl, would you?

34:32.480 --> 34:33.760
Is it that Jinzhao?

34:36.679 --> 34:37.600
So what if it is?

34:38.719 --> 34:39.480
And what if it isn't?

34:39.639 --> 34:40.679
If it isn't, good.

34:41.239 --> 34:42.040
If it is,

34:42.320 --> 34:42.920
then I advise you,

34:42.920 --> 34:44.120
forget it early.

34:44.400 --> 34:45.360
You're the heir,

34:45.639 --> 34:46.520
destined to inherit

34:46.520 --> 34:47.719
the entire Marquis Manor.

34:48.159 --> 34:48.960
A girl from the Gu family,

34:49.320 --> 34:50.239
let alone Jinzhao,

34:50.440 --> 34:51.199
even Lian wouldn't be

34:51.199 --> 34:52.280
a match for you.

34:53.199 --> 34:54.280
I shouldn't have

34:54.560 --> 34:55.280
let you stay

34:55.280 --> 34:56.400
at the Gu Manor so often.

34:57.960 --> 34:58.880
All these girls

34:58.920 --> 35:00.120
have only caused unnecessary trouble.

35:01.840 --> 35:02.520
I'll keep this

35:02.880 --> 35:04.000
from our parents for now.

35:04.400 --> 35:05.680
But you'd better know it.

35:06.160 --> 35:07.400
If father and mother find out,

35:07.400 --> 35:08.520
you know what the consequences will be.

35:08.920 --> 35:10.120
If you truly care for her,

35:10.240 --> 35:11.280
you should cut those feelings off

35:11.280 --> 35:12.080
early.

35:14.120 --> 35:14.960
Xianhuai!

35:17.600 --> 35:18.160
Miss.

35:18.520 --> 35:19.880
Go pack the Young Lord's things,

35:20.120 --> 35:20.920
he's returning to Marquis Manor.

35:22.440 --> 35:22.920
This…

35:23.480 --> 35:23.920
What,

35:24.200 --> 35:25.720
do my words not carry weight anymore?

35:25.760 --> 35:26.520
I wouldn't dare.

35:26.760 --> 35:27.400
I'll…

35:27.960 --> 35:28.880
go pack now.

35:44.880 --> 35:46.160
People always say gold and silver

35:46.320 --> 35:47.640
can't compare to something made by hand.

35:48.520 --> 35:49.720
Giving these to Mr. Chen,

35:50.040 --> 35:50.920
let alone him,

35:51.240 --> 35:52.400
I even find it tacky.

35:54.200 --> 35:55.520
[Mr. Jinrong's here!]

35:58.480 --> 35:59.320
Greetings, Jinzhao.

36:02.720 --> 36:04.400
You're…

36:05.920 --> 36:07.400
Just picking out a few suitable gifts

36:07.640 --> 36:09.080
for some social visits.

36:13.880 --> 36:14.720
Jinrong,

36:15.120 --> 36:16.000
what is it?

36:16.920 --> 36:17.560
Here's the thing.

36:18.600 --> 36:19.720
A while ago,

36:19.720 --> 36:21.160
I went to Yong'an Bridge

36:21.400 --> 36:22.800
and accidentally saw you

36:22.800 --> 36:23.880
with Mr. Chen's nephew,

36:23.880 --> 36:24.640
Chen Xuanqing.

36:27.680 --> 36:28.720
Well, don't misunderstand.

36:29.280 --> 36:30.600
I saw it,

36:30.840 --> 36:31.760
but I won't spread it.

36:32.000 --> 36:33.160
Not even

36:33.160 --> 36:34.120
to father and mother.

36:34.360 --> 36:35.360
Don't worry.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.400
A few days ago,

36:42.000 --> 36:43.880
you wanted to borrow 200 taels from me,

36:44.480 --> 36:46.240
I've got it ready.

36:46.680 --> 36:47.200
Well…

36:47.920 --> 36:49.240
Thank you, Jinzhao!

36:51.480 --> 36:52.320
But,

36:52.600 --> 36:54.400
since it's a loan, there are rules.

36:54.840 --> 36:56.320
Even between siblings,

36:56.760 --> 36:59.240
we still need signatures and fingerprints.

36:59.720 --> 37:01.160
Of course.

37:01.920 --> 37:04.040
Borrowed: 200 taels.

37:04.640 --> 37:05.440
Any collateral?

37:06.120 --> 37:07.200
I…

37:09.640 --> 37:10.920
If you don't have anything suitable,

37:11.160 --> 37:12.000
the jade bracelet

37:12.000 --> 37:13.520
you gave me that day will do, alright?

37:14.240 --> 37:14.800
Alright!

37:16.360 --> 37:17.720
You really are straightforward.

37:28.520 --> 37:30.040
Six-month term,

37:30.120 --> 37:32.440
with three months' interest
added upon maturity…

37:34.560 --> 37:35.160
This…

37:35.680 --> 37:36.920
This is "9 out, 13 return"?

37:37.400 --> 37:38.160
Jinzhao, you…

37:38.160 --> 37:38.880
I didn't expect you

37:38.880 --> 37:40.240
to know pawnshop rules so well,

37:40.560 --> 37:42.080
even that kind of loan sharking math.

37:45.160 --> 37:45.640
Well,

37:46.520 --> 37:47.840
at that rate,

37:48.000 --> 37:49.200
I'm afraid I won't be able to pay it back.

37:51.040 --> 37:52.200
Are you out of your mind?

37:52.560 --> 37:54.360
That jade bracelet was
a gift from you anyway.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.680
Even if you can't repay it,

37:55.840 --> 37:56.680
what's there to fear?

37:58.640 --> 37:59.320
Oh, right!

37:59.640 --> 38:00.440
I really was being silly.

38:01.440 --> 38:02.160
Thank you, Jinzhao.

38:02.360 --> 38:02.880
Alright.

38:05.520 --> 38:06.640
If no objections,

38:06.880 --> 38:07.960
just sign and press your seal.

38:08.600 --> 38:09.120
Okay.

38:34.000 --> 38:35.080
Same handwriting,

38:36.200 --> 38:37.400
same fingerprint.

38:39.880 --> 38:40.560
This pawn ticket

38:40.920 --> 38:41.720
really is yours.

38:41.920 --> 38:42.400
This…

38:42.520 --> 38:43.000
You…

38:43.920 --> 38:44.480
Wait,

38:45.200 --> 38:46.040
I specifically skipped

38:46.040 --> 38:47.080
Ji's pawnshop

38:47.280 --> 38:48.280
and went to He's,

38:48.480 --> 38:49.040
how did you…

38:49.040 --> 38:50.120
You didn't know.

38:50.400 --> 38:51.360
He's Pawnshop

38:51.520 --> 38:52.800
also has a 30% share from the Ji family.

38:54.960 --> 38:56.200
An official kiln vase

38:56.800 --> 38:58.080
and a jade ring,

38:58.600 --> 38:59.920
valued at 150 taels.

39:03.000 --> 39:04.400
What do you need so much silver for?

39:04.960 --> 39:06.480
Is it also for your classmate's sister's

39:06.760 --> 39:07.480
dowry?

39:08.320 --> 39:09.360
This is…

39:10.080 --> 39:10.680
Say it!

39:11.280 --> 39:12.560
What are you borrowing so much money for?

39:13.120 --> 39:14.520
You've even learned to pawn things now!

39:15.520 --> 39:16.600
If you lie,

39:16.680 --> 39:17.640
I'll take this ticket

39:17.880 --> 39:18.920
straight to mother

39:19.280 --> 39:20.160
or even father!

39:20.160 --> 39:20.720
No!

39:21.480 --> 39:22.040
Jinzhao,

39:22.040 --> 39:23.440
please don't tell them!

39:24.200 --> 39:25.200
I'll tell you.

39:27.960 --> 39:29.760
Actually…

39:30.200 --> 39:31.640
It was the month before last,

39:32.120 --> 39:33.840
a classmate of mine was
going back to his hometown

39:34.120 --> 39:35.600
and invited us over for a drink.

39:36.200 --> 39:37.440
I accidentally broke

39:37.560 --> 39:38.560
a teacup there.

39:39.240 --> 39:40.200
What teacup

39:40.560 --> 39:42.160
costs 150 taels of silver?

39:43.280 --> 39:44.520
It's Chenghua doucai kiln!

39:45.000 --> 39:46.320
That jade thumb ring

39:46.600 --> 39:47.840
was from mother.

39:48.280 --> 39:49.720
The pawn deadline is coming up,

39:49.920 --> 39:51.080
and I don't have money to redeem it.

39:51.680 --> 39:53.280
So I came to ask you for a loan.

39:53.840 --> 39:55.040
Whatever it takes,

39:55.040 --> 39:56.320
I have to get it back.

39:59.040 --> 39:59.600
Really.

40:01.520 --> 40:02.240
Qingpu,

40:03.440 --> 40:04.880
bring a 200 tael bank draft.

40:05.680 --> 40:07.160
Yes, Miss.

40:08.440 --> 40:09.600
Thank you, Jinzhao!

40:24.680 --> 40:26.160
First a classmate's sister,

40:26.760 --> 40:28.160
then an imperial kiln teacup.

40:28.560 --> 40:29.640
All nonsense.

40:31.080 --> 40:31.720
Qingpu,

40:32.040 --> 40:33.200
ask Mr. Ping to send two men

40:33.440 --> 40:34.400
to watch him closely.

40:35.160 --> 40:36.240
I want to see

40:36.520 --> 40:37.720
what he's really doing.

40:38.200 --> 40:39.160
Yes, Miss.

40:52.720 --> 40:53.800
Watch out!

40:55.600 --> 40:56.480
What happened?

40:57.480 --> 40:58.040
My lord,

40:58.240 --> 40:59.200
someone almost hit us.

41:00.720 --> 41:01.600
When did the capital

41:01.600 --> 41:02.760
get so polite?

41:03.080 --> 41:04.160
Not even a curse.

41:06.440 --> 41:07.480
No wonder,

41:07.840 --> 41:09.280
he's rushing off to gamble.

41:11.720 --> 41:12.840
A gambling house.

41:15.720 --> 41:16.680
No signboard?

41:17.080 --> 41:18.080
You don't know, my lord.

41:18.440 --> 41:19.280
The more hidden it is,

41:19.520 --> 41:20.480
the bigger the business.

41:21.160 --> 41:22.480
It must have backing.

41:23.840 --> 41:24.760
Whoever runs this

41:24.760 --> 41:25.440
is really shady.

41:27.200 --> 41:27.760
Go.

41:27.760 --> 41:28.560
Let's go, this way.

41:28.560 --> 41:29.120
It's near.

41:29.280 --> 41:30.440
Masters, please come in.

41:30.440 --> 41:31.400
[Good luck today.]

41:31.400 --> 41:32.440
Gu Jinrong?

41:35.040 --> 41:35.880
Didn't expect him

41:35.880 --> 41:36.960
to be a gambler.

41:37.960 --> 41:39.280
Turns out he is.

41:40.160 --> 41:41.240
Wonder if Miss Gu

41:41.240 --> 41:42.400
knows about this.

41:43.040 --> 41:44.160
She definitely doesn't.

41:44.720 --> 41:45.760
Otherwise, with her temper,

41:46.280 --> 41:47.480
she'd kill him.

41:51.520 --> 41:52.280
Let's go.

41:54.320 --> 41:54.800
Go.

42:02.560 --> 42:03.320
So,

42:03.800 --> 42:05.240
he's not gambling himself,

42:05.800 --> 42:07.880
he's recruiting for the gambling house?

42:08.160 --> 42:08.960
Exactly.

42:09.120 --> 42:10.280
I saw it myself.

42:10.440 --> 42:12.000
Mr. Jingrong didn't play,

42:12.280 --> 42:13.920
he led those gamblers

42:13.920 --> 42:14.840
into a private room.

42:15.320 --> 42:16.040
So,

42:16.240 --> 42:17.840
he's working for the gambling house

42:18.320 --> 42:19.400
as a frontman.

42:19.720 --> 42:21.000
A frontman.

42:21.840 --> 42:22.760
Normally,

42:22.760 --> 42:23.840
that should pay well.

42:24.200 --> 42:25.960
Then why does he still pawn things?

42:26.120 --> 42:27.080
Because that private room

42:27.080 --> 42:28.720
was rented by him.

42:28.960 --> 42:30.080
Gambling house rules say,

42:30.080 --> 42:30.840
to lease a room,

42:30.840 --> 42:32.440
one should pay three months upfront.

42:33.120 --> 42:34.600
Mr. Jingrong

42:34.600 --> 42:35.600
must be short on money,

42:35.880 --> 42:36.880
that's why

42:37.080 --> 42:38.120
he pawned things.

42:39.680 --> 42:40.400
I see.

42:41.040 --> 42:43.160
This needs to be handled fast.

42:44.120 --> 42:46.000
Even if he doesn't gamble himself,

42:46.560 --> 42:47.880
luring others in is worse

42:48.360 --> 42:50.280
than gambling himself.

42:54.240 --> 42:55.160
The Ministry of Rites

42:55.160 --> 42:56.600
sent the imperial exam pass list
for this round.

43:00.080 --> 43:00.680
Sir,

43:01.200 --> 43:02.920
people are talking outside,

43:03.840 --> 43:04.640
saying Mr. Xuanqing

43:04.640 --> 43:05.760
has your backing.

43:06.160 --> 43:07.080
He'll likely rank top

43:07.480 --> 43:08.560
in the palace exam.

43:09.360 --> 43:10.400
Too much attention

43:11.000 --> 43:12.000
may not be a good thing.

43:12.240 --> 43:12.880
Then,

43:13.640 --> 43:14.400
can we stop it?

43:14.720 --> 43:15.520
How can we?

43:17.800 --> 43:18.840
If His Majesty and my teacher

43:18.840 --> 43:20.000
both intend to promote him,

43:20.800 --> 43:21.880
how could I

43:22.120 --> 43:23.080
refuse their goodwill?

43:26.720 --> 43:27.480
Sir,

43:27.840 --> 43:29.160
the Ji family sent gifts.

43:29.320 --> 43:30.000
Leave them there.

43:36.120 --> 43:37.360
According to Mr. Luo,

43:37.520 --> 43:39.160
these were personally chosen

43:39.160 --> 43:40.000
by Miss Gu.

43:40.080 --> 43:41.160
He said they were not enough

43:41.160 --> 43:42.600
to repay you for saving Miss Gu,

43:43.360 --> 43:44.960
just a token of gratitude

43:45.400 --> 43:47.160
and to ease their own conscience.

43:48.360 --> 43:49.760
He's got a silver tongue.

43:53.880 --> 43:54.520
This is…

43:55.080 --> 43:56.200
A double-barreled telescope!

43:59.080 --> 44:00.080
Much clearer

44:00.080 --> 44:00.920
than the single-tube one.

44:01.640 --> 44:03.120
The Ji family is wealthy.

44:03.520 --> 44:05.400
When Fujian opened trade back then,

44:05.400 --> 44:06.080
they also

44:06.080 --> 44:07.440
took a share of the profits.

44:08.280 --> 44:09.440
Half the Western goods

44:09.440 --> 44:10.880
you see in the capital now

44:11.240 --> 44:12.640
are brought in

44:12.840 --> 44:14.360
by the Ji family's merchant ships.

44:15.200 --> 44:16.680
Miss Gu really put thought into this.

44:22.200 --> 44:22.880
What is this?

44:23.320 --> 44:24.640
Looks like…

44:24.960 --> 44:25.800
a pair of eyeglasses.

44:26.080 --> 44:26.760
I've heard of them.

44:27.120 --> 44:28.880
For people with poor eyesight, right?

44:33.240 --> 44:35.200
Are you sure Mr. Luo said

44:36.120 --> 44:37.200
these gifts were all

44:37.200 --> 44:38.760
chosen by Miss Gu herself?

44:39.160 --> 44:39.880
Yes.

44:40.600 --> 44:41.920
They also said

44:42.720 --> 44:44.640
those were things you could use.

44:45.920 --> 44:46.760
Throw them all out.

44:47.840 --> 44:48.640
Yes.

44:52.880 --> 44:53.800
Forget it.
